  "label": "Dehumanizing joke",
  "description": "A joke that reduces a person or group to an object or a statistic, stripping away their humanity. The meme's comparison of the victims' deaths to a 'reading speed' is a dehumanizing joke that mocks their suffering and dignity. This concept is essential to understanding the meme's offensive nature.",
